SESS for OpenClaw

This package is prepared for distribution under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
It is a native OpenClaw plugin maintained by SESS. It is not an official OpenClaw
package and is not endorsed by the OpenClaw project.

It depends on @sess.si/sdk (Apache-2.0) for all SESS HTTP, decoding and receipt
verification. OpenClaw (MIT) is the host application and is not bundled or installed
by this package. The hosted SESS runtime and renderer are not included.
